  "id": "cant_d_estil_valencia",
  "name": "Cant d'estil (Valencian sung style-song)",
  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Cant d'estil is the virtuoso solo song of the Valencian Horta and the surrounding comarques, often performed as a sung joust between singers, in forms such as l'u, l'u i dos and l'u i dotze; the last two are exclusively Valencian, while l'u belongs to the fandango family. Its accompaniment combines strings (guitar and guitarró) with wind instruments such as clarinet, trumpet and trombone, and the related albaes are night serenades sung to dolçaina and tabalet. The classical-guitar card stands for the guitar and guitarró, and the credited-horns card for the trumpet and trombone.",
  "recipe": "classic modern cant d'estil, ballad Poetry, Mediterranean ballad branch. solo with instrumental accompaniment, single lead single track no stacking. classical nylon-string guitar, grenadilla African blackwood traditional clarinet, credited horns unspecified. field recording. ORTF stereo pair, portable field-recorder pre. 24-bit digital.",
